**Potential coalitions:**

[? if collectivist_relation >= 40 and left_coalition >= 45: United Left Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>[? if sapd_formed:  + <span style="color: #9B0000;">**Laborists**</span>?]): [+ left_coalition +]% ?]

[? if collectivist_relation > 35 and unionist_relation > 35 and not concord_formed: Popular Front Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span>[? if (liberal_parliament == 0 and bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 0) and not lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if sapd_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">**Laborists**</span>?]): [+ popular_front_coalition +]% ?]

[? if not concord_formed: Unity Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed:<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if sapd_formed and collectivist_relation >= 30:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #9B0000;">**Laborists**</span>?]): [+ weimar_coalition +]% ?]

[? if concord_formed: <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">Liberal</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">Liberal</span>?] Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]): [+ social_liberal_coalition +]% ?]

[? if concord_formed: <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span>): [+ social_catholic_coalition +]% ?]

[? if gold_exist and not concord_formed: Unity Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]): [+ grand_coalition +]% ?]

[? if bourgeois_coalition >= 25 and not kvp_formed: Propertied Coalition (<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others**): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]% ?]

[? if bourgeois_coalition >= 25 and kvp_formed: Propertied Coalition (<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others** + <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CPP**</span>): [+ bourgeois_coalition +]% ?]

[? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate" and not lvp_formed and not concord_formed: Center-Right Coalition (<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others**[? if not concord_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?]): [+ center_right_coalition +]% ?]

[? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical" or lvp_formed and not concord_formed: Right-wing Coalition (<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed and gold_exist: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others**[? if not concord_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?]): [+ right_coalition +]% ?]

[? if (concord_formed and far_right_coalition >= 25) or (gallax_right_coalition >= 50 and rubicon): Black-Brown Coalition (<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>): [+ gallax_right_coalition +]% ?]

[? if gnu_formed: Staal Right Coalition (<span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and gold_exist and not gold_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if not other_gnu:&nbsp;+ **Others**?][? if kvp_formed and not kvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**CPP**</span>?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate" and not traditionalist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if dsu_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**CSG**</span>?]): [+ staal_right_coalition +]% ?]

[? if gnu_formed: Staal Left Coalition (<span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> + <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]): [+ staal_left_coalition +]% ?]

[? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical" and far_right_coalition >= 35 and not concord_formed: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> Coalition ([? if (gold_leader == "Coalfax" and gold_ideology == "Right" and gold_right - gold_left >= 15) or hugenberg_gold: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> + ?]<span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> + <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>): [+ far_right_coalition +]% ?]

[? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate" and far_right_coalition >= 30: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Far</span>-<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span> Coalition ([? if (gold_leader == "Coalfax" and gold_ideology == "Right" and gold_right - gold_left >= 15) or hugenberg_gold: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> + ?]<span style="color: #003755;">**CNF**</span> + <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>): [+ far_right_coalition +]% ?]

[? if royalist_urgency <= 1 and royalist_r >= 15 : The rapid rise in <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> votes is extremely worrying. Many had believed that the party was <span style="color: #ff0000;">moribund</span>; now, some of us consider it to be the greatest threat to democracy in the Commonwealth. ?]

[? if anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 and traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": Together, the anti-democratic <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>, and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> have a majority in the Assembly. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

[? if anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 and traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": Together, the anti-democratic <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, <span style="color: #003755;">**CNF**</span>, and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> have a majority in the Assembly. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

[? if gallax_right_coalition >= 50 and rubicon and gallax_right_coalition_time == time: The <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> and its <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">Avrizan</span> counterpart, together with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>, constitute a majority in the Assembly. This has sparked rumors of a potential parliamentary-backed Black-Brown coalition that could unseat [+ chancellor +]—rumors that are unlikely to materialize, as the ideological gulf between the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and the constitutionalist <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span> remains vast. ?]

[? if change_royalist_votes < -2 and rubicon and royalist_decline_time == time: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> have finally declined. Many who once backed the movement as a protest vote never actually wanted them in power, while others have simply stayed home. Disillusioned conservatives and religious voters have drifted back to the conservative and middle parties to their left. Perhaps the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> have peaked—they cannot win new voters without alienating their existing base. ?]

[? if marcher_votes < 20 and staal_marcher_r >= 3: Our poor electoral results have led Staal to question the wisdom of collaborating with a party on the brink, one that can’t even secure a fifth of the vote. Many within our own party now blame our ties with the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> general as a major factor behind our disappointing electoral results. ?][? if marcher_votes < 25 and marcher_votes > 20 and staal_marcher_r >= 5: Our poor electoral results have led Staal to question the wisdom of collaborating with a party on the brink, one that can’t even secure a quarter of the vote. Many within our own party now blame our ties with the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> general as a major factor behind our disappointing electoral results. ?]

[? if marcher_votes >= 35 and left_strength >= reformist_strength + labor_strength: Our strong performance has, unfortunately, driven our former propertied coalition partners to distance themselves from us. They blame their electoral defeats on their association with us and refuse to spend their dwindling influence supporting a government with the leverage to transform the Commonwealth into <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformism</span>. ?]

[? if left_coalition >= 50: The fact that the <span style="color: #9B0000;">Vaelist</span> parties now hold a majority in the Assembly by themselves has energized the grassroots of both our parties to push for closer cooperation. ?]

[? if election_boycott: We have boycotted this election, delegitimizing the results in the eyes of workers and <span style="color: #000000;">repu</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">bli</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">cans</span> alike. The impact is measured by how many stayed home instead of voting for the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>. [? if boycott_effect < 1.05: In the end, we achieved only limited success—our boycott has proven relatively unimpactful. So much effort, for nothing. ?][? if boycott_effect >= 1.05 and boycott_effect < 1.1: In the end, we achieved notable success. ?][? if boycott_effect >= 1.1: In the end, we achieved smashing success. ?] ?]

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

