@wholesome_coalition
title: A "wholesome" coalition is formed.
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>[? if not lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]+[? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> + **Others** ([+ cordon_sanitaire +]%)
view-if: cordon_sanitaire >= 50 and ((traditionalist_leader == "Trevannon" and true_christian_democracy) or (traditionalist_leader == "Maine" and lambach_stays)) and wacky_weimar
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">Arcanists</span>[? if not lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?]+[? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span> + Others ([+ cordon_sanitaire +]%) [? if traditionalist_relation < 50: We need higher relations with the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span>. ?][? if unionist_relation < 50: We need higher relations with the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Concord</span>?]. ?]
choose-if: traditionalist_relation >= 50 and unionist_relation >= 50
on-arrival: leverage -= 10; in_wholesome_coalition = 1; in_grand_coalition = 1; marcher_in_government = 1; foreign_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; interior_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; justice_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; justice_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; labor_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; army_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; economic_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; finance_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; agriculture_minister_party = "Traditionalist"; pro_republic += 100; dufour_angry = -500; 

We have successfully formed a "wholesome" coalition of all the so-called "constitutional" parties. Who should be chancellor?

- @treviranus
- @noske

@noske
title: Brask for Chancellor.
on-arrival: chancellor = "Brask"; chancellor_party = "Marcher"; left_dissent += 100
go-to: ministries

We have brought back Brask from retirement to serve as our chancellor. A triumph, of sorts.

@treviranus
title: Trevannon for Chancellor.
on-arrival: chancellor = "Trevannon"; chancellor_party = "Traditionalist"; leverage += 10; wholesome_point += 1;
go-to: ministries

Giving Trevannon the chancellorship will lend us more leverage.

@schleicher_majority_coalition
title: Staal forms a majority government with only the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>.
subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> ([+ gnu_r +]%)
view-if: gnu_r >= 50 and chancellor == "Staal" and staal_time and gnu_formed
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">GNU</span> ([+ gnu_r +]%)
on-arrival: in_staal_majority_coalition = 1; vice_chancellor = "Hammerton"; heartland_leader = "Goodlake" if heartland_leader == "Staal" or heartland_leader == "Crowde" or (heartland_leader == "Sedgewick" and unionist_in_gov); dsu_in_gov = 0; unionist_in_gov = 0; foreign_minister_party = "GNU"; interior_minister_party = "GNU"; justice_minister_party = "GNU"; labor_minister_party = "GNU"; army_minister_party = "GNU"; economic_minister_party = "GNU"; finance_minister_party = "GNU"; agriculture_minister_party = "GNU"; army_minister = "Staal"; pro_republic = 0; staal_marcher_r -= 4; staal_marcher_support -= 2

Immediately after the election, the chancellor abandoned both dialogue and the appearance of cordiality with the other political parties. Power is his, and he intends to keep it.

Without the constraints of the parliamentary system, he can do whatever he pleases. Only the collapse of his delicately built house of cards could topple a <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> majority government.

@schleicher_left_coalition
title: Staal forms a parliamentary cabinet with the left.
subtitle: <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> + <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>[? if not unionist_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>?][? if not lvp_formed and not dstp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed and not lvp_gnu:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] ([+ staal_left_coalition +]%)
