Collectivists</span> are unwilling to compromise at all. ?] [? if rubicon: - DuFour would never permit it. ?] [? if president_ideology = "Right": - President [+ president +] is fiercely opposed to <span style="color: #9B0000;">Reformist</span> governance. ?]
