@popular_front_prussia

The coalition negotiations were going relatively smoothly until the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> brought up the topic of a reorganization of the Heartland government to include themselves. [? if in_grand_coalition_heartland: This means that we are forced to kick the <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> from the ruling coalition to accommodate. ?][? if in_weimar_coalition_heartland and not in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland: This means that we are to add the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> to the ruling Unity coalition, to form an oversized coalition. ?][? if in_weimar_coalition_heartland and in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland: This means that we are to add the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> to the ruling Unity coalition, to form a majority Popular Front coalition. ?]

*Something* must be done to restore balance, again.

- @popular_front_resources_2
- @popular_front_relations
- @popular_front_prussia_weimar
- @popular_front_prussia_groko
