Somehow, surprisingly, the coalition is successfully formed! We still need a chancellor; the only acceptable choice among the parties was Calbert Yardley of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, acceptable to the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> [? if president == "DuFour" or president_ideology == "Moderate": as well as President [+ president +], albeit extremely reluctantly ?].

@popular_front_no_civil_war
on-arrival: collectivist_goals_seen = 0; finance_minister_party = "Unionist"; interior_minister_party = "Unionist"; justice_minister_party = "Unionist"; ddp_in_popular_front = 1 if (liberal_parliament = 0 and bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 0 and not lvp_formed); justice_minister_party = ddp_name if ddp_in_popular_front; economic_minister_party = "Unionist"; economic_minister_party = ddp_name if ddp_in_popular_front; labor_minister_party = "Unionist"; foreign_minister_party = "Unionist"; agriculture_minister_party = "Unionist"; army_minister = "I"; leverage += collectivist_r; leverage += ddp_r if liberal_parliament = 1 or bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 1; gold_right += 6; ddp_right += 3; lvp_right += 5; ddp_cohesion -= 2 if liberal_parliament = 0; liberal_cooperation += 5 if liberal_parliament = 1 or bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 1; bourgeois_cooperation += 5; liberal_cooperation += 3 if ((liberal_parliament = 1 or bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 1) and (in_popular_front_heartland or in_left_front_heartland)); bourgeois_cooperation += 3 if (in_popular_front_heartland or in_left_front_heartland); gold_relation -= 5; ddp_relation -= 5 if liberal_parliament = 1 or bourgeois_parliament_ddp == 1; lvp_relation -= 5; reformist_dissent += 20; reformist_strength -= 10; left_dissent -= 20; left_strength += 15; leverage += marcher_r if support_collectivist_grand; leverage += collectivist_r if support_collectivist_grand; dufour_angry += 10 if (in_popular_front_heartland or in_left_front_heartland); 
achievement: volksfront

In response to the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>'s entrance into the government, the right-wing takes a "wait-and-see" approach for now. They expect that the Popular Front government will be unstable and incompetent, and will collapse of its own accord, discrediting the left and center and eventually enabling the destruction of the Unity Republic. Our task is to prove them wrong. [? if in_popular_front_heartland: The right will be more active in resisting our rule considering we are also ruling with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> in Heartland too. ?]

The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> has taken an abstentionist position with regards to ministries. They claim to be participating as the "loyal opposition" within the Popular Front government, supporting us from the outside while also running their own propaganda campaigns to turn workers to their side. They seem to expect that the Popular Front would inevitably fail, and that our failure would benefit them. 

- @ministries: First, we must select our ministries.


@popular_front_civil_war
on-arrival: collectivist_relation = 80; army_loyalty += 0.25;

In response to the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>'s entrance into the government, the right-wing immediately launches a coup attempt. Troops of the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> enter Axton and immediately begin clashing with our supporters! <span style="color: #808080;">Reactionary</span> officers within the Commonwealth Army have taken their troops out of the barracks and joined them with the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span> to stop us from taking power.

The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] manages to diffuse some of the hostility from the Commonwealth Army and the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Wardens**</span>, but fail to prevent the outbreak of fighting. We are forced to fight on the same side as the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, whether we want to or not.

- @march_on_berlin_2: Fight against the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Sovereigntists</span>!

@far_right_coalition
title: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Far</span>-[? if not dnf_formed:<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>?][? if dnf_formed:<span style="color: #003755;">right</span>?] Coalition
subtitle: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> + [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> ?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**CNF**</span> ?] ([+ far_right_coalition +]%)
