@hindenburg_appoints_papen
on-arrival: chancellor = "Goodryke"; chancellor_party = "I"; next_election_time = time+3; next_election_month = month + 3; next_election_year = year; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; loyalist_banned = 0; pro_republic -= 8; finance_minister_party = "I"; interior_minister_party = "I"; economic_minister_party = "I"; labor_minister_party = "I"; foreign_minister_party = "I"; agriculture_minister_party = "I"; army_minister = "I"; papen_chancellor_timer = 4
face-image: img/portraits/PapenFranz.jpg

There is no path to a majority government. President DuFour is tired of the chaos, and appoints Ferris Goodryke as chancellor instead of Askew. Goodryke is a independent formerly from the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?], and is significantly to the right of the majority of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?].

Goodryke is immediately faced with a vote of no confidence, given his unpopularity. However the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> votes, he is guaranteed to fall, due to the unanimous hatred against him from all other parties.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year + 2365 +].

@no_majority_bruning_toleration
on-arrival: no_majority_bruning_elections += 1

There is no path to a majority government. One option would be to have a continuation of the current Askew government; if we tolerate it, then it would retain a majority vote against no-confidence.

The third option is to have new elections.

- @toleration_bruning: We will tolerate Askew.
- @toleration_bruning_right: We will tolerate Askew's right coalition.
- @new_elections: We will have new elections.
- @unity_government


@unity_government
title: The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] offers a "Government of National Unity" under Chancellor Joseph Werth.
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others** ([+ neo_weimar_coalition +]%)
