Staal's supporting parties have failed to secure a majority coalition in the Assembly—at least, not one the chancellor finds acceptable. [? if gnu_formed: He demands total power for the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>, unwilling to let other parties hold his government hostage. ?]

[? if staal_right_coalition >= 50: While a coalition of all right-wing factions around Staal is possible, he refuses to grant the Assembly new legitimacy and will press on with his presidential government.?] Thus, another continuation of the current governing coalition appears inevitable.

