Predictably, Trevannon has failed to assemble a majority coalition in support of his propertied-right cabinet. DuFour, increasingly frustrated and in rapid physical decline, may act more rashly than he did when appointing Goodryke a year ago.

With Goodryke back in his inner circle after Staal’s fall, and his disillusionment with his <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> allies deepening, the future grows more uncertain. We don't know what DuFour is planning on as a last resort.

Once again, the question stands before us: do we choose to tolerate this cabinet? That is for you to decide.

The new Assembly will convene on [+ next_reichstag_month : month +] [+ next_reichstag_year + 2365 +], Week [+ next_reichstag_week +].

