@drop_cvp_women
title: Drop our promise to abandon efforts toward Women's and <span style="color: red;">Ho</span><span style="color: orange;">m</span><span style="color: yellow;">o</span><span style="color: green;">se</span><span style="color: blue;">xu</span><span style="color: purple;">al</span> rights.
