We have somehow convinced the <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> to enter in a <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-<span style="color: #000000;">Faithful</span> Coalition with us! The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">nationalist</span> elements within the <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> are disgusted by this, never actually expecting the negotiations to have a successful conclusion. They're refusing to participate in government through cabinet positions as to not be associated with the <span style="color: #c00000;">Reformists</span>.

