The [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] chancellor is likely to be Edmund Askew of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?][? if chancellor = "Askew" : &nbsp;again?]. He is known for his conservatism and sympathy for monarchism, being on the [? if not concord_formed: right wing?][? if concord_formed: left wing?] of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] and Sedgewick's protege. 

