However the propertied are in a parliamentary group which prevents the liberal parties from from being included in our coalition by themselves. We can either spend resources to convince the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> to break away from this arrangement, or to find another governing arrangement. The <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span> is very reluctant to this step.

