There are enough votes to form a majority coalition consisting of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] (<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span>), <span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Avrizan People's**</span> (<span style="color: #A2D8E0;">**Arcanists**</span>), [? if ddp_name == "Gold" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**Democratic**</span>?][? if ddp_name == "CSP" and not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**State**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] [? if not lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>)?][? if lvp_formed: (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?][? if not lvp_formed: , and <span style="color: #C0A054;">**People's**</span> (<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>)?] parties. Given our rather weak electoral performance, [? if marcher_no_confidence = 1 : and our previous vote of no confidence against the government, ?][? if no_confidence_against_marcher = 1 : and the vote of no confidence against us, ?] President [+ president +] has asked the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] to take the lead role in forming a government.


